## SEO Section

Kids' Birthday Parties at
AeroSports Scarborough
Looking for the best place to celebrate your child's birthday? Look no further than AeroSports Trampoline Park Scarborough! Our facility offers an exhilarating environment where kids can jump, play, and enjoy their special day. We proudly serve families in Scarborough ,Toronto , Markham, North York  and surrounding areas, making us a top choice for birthday celebrations in the Greater Toronto Area (GTA).
Why Choose Us for Your Kids' Birthday Party?
At AeroSports, we understand the importance of making every birthday a memorable experience. Here are some reasons why we are the best venue for kids' birthday parties:
Exciting Party Packages
Our customizable birthday party packages are designed to fit every child's interests, providing endless fun and excitement.
Expert Party Planners
Our dedicated event planners will help you organize the perfect celebration, from start to finish, ensuring a stress-free experience for parents.
Variety of Activities
Enjoy our trampoline courts, dodgeball arena, and air bags—everything you need for a fun-filled birthday celebration.
Priority!
Safety First
Our trained staff oversee all activities, ensuring a safe environment for kids to enjoy their party to the fullest.

[2] (source: birthday_parties.md)
## Terms & Conditions

Birthday party terms and conditions at AeroSports Scarborough: Rescheduling is free and allowed up to 1 year from booking date. Cancellation with 14+ days notice receives a store gift card for the refund amount. Cancellation within 14 days receives no refund. Package changes must be made 14+ days in advance, subject to availability. Waivers are required for all jumpers (under 18 must be signed by parent/guardian, valid 1 year). Room supplies (plates, cups, tablecloths) are included. The jumping area is shared with other patrons but the party room is private. Prohibited items: no piñatas, confetti, or silly string ($40 cleaning charge if used). Advise of food allergies/sensitivities in advance. All guests should arrive 20 minutes early for check-in. AeroSports is not responsible for lost or stolen items.

